# Translation of Payobook (pb_payroll_ai_insights) into Vietnamese.
# Phase D1: PayAI's data queries run with the asker's access rights, so a
# refusal is now something a user READS, verbatim — no model rewrites it.
# Every sentence a refusal can print ships in both languages, and
# tests/test_data_access.py asserts that this file covers every one of them.
msgid ""
msgstr ""
